{"timestamp": 1779393311.069659, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 23, "data": {"caller": "player_0", "reason": "Alice reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "security", "victim_name": "Bob"}, {"room": "lower_engine", "victim_name": "Frank"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779393311.070289, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 23, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779393334.042922, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 23, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I reported Bob\u2019s body in Security. My route was storage \u2192 lower_engine \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons \u2192 security.\n\nI saw Eve in upper_engine around ticks 11-13. I saw Diana enter upper_engine from medbay at 11, then later Diana went oxygen \u2192 cafeteria at 17, cafeteria \u2192 weapons at 19, stayed in weapons around 20-21, then left weapons toward Security at 22. I went to Security right after and found Bob dead there, with Diana in the room.\n\nSo I\u2019m not hard accusing yet, but Diana was the only person I saw near Bob\u2019s body and needs to explain what happened in Security. Also Frank is dead too, but I didn\u2019t find that body."}}
{"timestamp": 1779393355.4408162, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 23, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My route was electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 lower_engine \u2192 back through upper_engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 cafeteria. I did not see either body.\n\nI can confirm part of Alice\u2019s story: I saw Diana enter medbay from electrical around tick 8, then Diana entered upper_engine from medbay at tick 11. Alice also entered upper_engine from lower_engine at tick 11. I was with both Alice and Diana in upper_engine around ticks 11-13.\n\nAfter that I went away toward lower_engine / oxygen / cafeteria, so I didn\u2019t see what happened in Security. But Alice\u2019s upper_engine timing matches what I saw. Diana definitely needs to explain Security if Alice found Bob there with Diana in the room. Not hard voting yet, but that\u2019s the main info I have."}}
{"timestamp": 1779393396.60692, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 23, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route was navigation -> security -> weapons -> cafeteria -> electrical -> medbay -> upper_engine -> lower_engine -> storage.\n\nI can confirm Bob was in Security early on, around tick 6 when I passed through. I left him there alive and moved on. If Alice just found Diana standing over Bob's body in Security, that is incredibly damning for Diana. \n\nAs for Frank, I actually saw him alive in lower_engine around tick 20 just before I moved down to storage. So whoever killed Frank had to have done it in the last few seconds on that side of the map. \n\nBut right now, Alice caught Diana at the scene of the crime for Bob. That's our strongest lead by far, so I think we have to vote Diana today."}}
{"timestamp": 1779393435.932775, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 23, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My route was medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons, then I was heading into Security when the report happened.\n\nImportant: Alice was with me in Weapons at ticks 20, 21, and 22. I saw her there the whole time. So if she\u2019s saying I \u201cleft Weapons toward Security,\u201d she was literally right there too and followed right after. I did not kill Bob \u2014 I entered Security and the report happened basically immediately. I didn\u2019t even get a chance to report.\n\nAlso, I saw Frank alive earlier in electrical/medbay around ticks 7-9. Charlie is the only one claiming Frank was alive in lower_engine around tick 20, and Charlie\u2019s route puts him near both Security early and lower_engine/storage late. That feels really convenient, especially with him pushing so hard on me.\n\nI think Bob may have been dead in Security before Alice and I got there, or Alice is framing me, but Charlie\u2019s story around Frank is the biggest unresolved thing. I\u2019m not the duck."}}
{"timestamp": 1779393466.456927, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 23, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I want to clarify: yes, I was in Weapons with Diana around 20-21. I saw Diana leave Weapons toward Security at tick 22, and I followed right after. When I got into Security at tick 23, Bob\u2019s body was there and Diana was in the room, so I reported immediately.\n\nIt\u2019s possible Bob was already dead before Diana entered, but from my perspective she was the only person I directly saw at the body. If she had just entered and seen it, she should\u2019ve reported too, but the report happened as soon as I arrived.\n\nFrank is still unresolved. Charlie\u2019s claim that Frank was alive in lower_engine around tick 20 is important, but unconfirmed. For Bob specifically, Diana is still the strongest suspect from what I saw."}}
{"timestamp": 1779393493.5516539, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 23, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I\u2019m starting to think Diana at Bob\u2019s body may be a timing trap rather than the full answer. Alice and Diana being together in Weapons at 20-22 means Diana would have had basically only the instant she entered Security to kill Bob before Alice arrived. That\u2019s possible, but very tight.\n\nCharlie is the one whose route worries me more now: he admits he was in Security early with Bob alive, and he\u2019s the only person claiming Frank was alive in lower_engine around tick 20 \u2014 right where his own route was. If Bob was killed early and left in Security, then Charlie could have killed Bob, moved around, then killed Frank late.\n\nMy info still only hard-confirms Alice and Diana were both with me in upper_engine at 11-13. But based on both bodies, I\u2019m more suspicious of Charlie than Diana right now."}}
{"timestamp": 1779393517.110361, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 23, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Eve, think about the timing for a second. If I killed Bob in Security all the way back at tick 6, you're telling me his body just sat there for 17 ticks\u2014almost the entire round\u2014and absolutely nobody else walked in until tick 23? That's highly unlikely. Bob almost certainly died much later.\n\nAnd regarding Frank, if I were the Duck who killed him in lower_engine at tick 20, why on earth would I volunteer that I was the last person to see him alive in that exact room? If I were guilty, I would have just lied and said I hadn't seen him at all. I gave you that information because I\u2019m genuinely trying to help us narrow down the timeline. \n\nRight now, we have Alice stating clearly that she walked into Security and found Diana with Bob's body. That is our strongest lead. Either Diana killed him right in that narrow window, or Alice killed him and self-reported to frame Diana. Let's not get distracted by wild theories about me when we have someone literally caught at the scene of the crime. I'm trusting Alice's report and voting Diana today."}}
{"timestamp": 1779393561.074958, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 23, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I need everyone to look at the timing, not just the body snapshot. Alice and I were together in Weapons at 20, 21, and 22. Security is right below Weapons. If I only left at 22 and Alice followed immediately, that gives me basically no real window to kill Bob before she arrives and reports. I walked into Security and the report happened almost instantly.\n\nMy actual route was medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons \u2192 toward Security. I saw Frank alive in electrical/medbay around 7-9. I saw Eve with me in upper_engine 11-13, and Alice also came into upper_engine from lower_engine around 11, then later I saw Alice in Weapons with me at 20-22.\n\nThe thing that accounts for both deaths best is Charlie. He admits he was in Security early with Bob alive, and he is the only person claiming Frank was alive in lower_engine around tick 20 \u2014 exactly where Charlie\u2019s route puts him late. Nobody confirms that Frank sighting. Bob\u2019s body sitting in Security is not impossible if nobody checked Security until Alice and I came down from Weapons.\n\nIf you vote me here, you\u2019re voting out a goose based on \u201cstanding near body\u201d timing that doesn\u2019t actually work. I think Charlie killed Bob early, killed Frank late, and is pushing hard on me because Alice found me entering Security. I\u2019m voting Charlie."}}
